     "body": "<p>This test always passes when I have <span class=\"error\">&#91;client&#93;</span> hyper-v enabled (which I do by default).  On a whim, I tried disabling hyper-v and  was able to reproduce the above errors.  Re-enabling hyper-v resulted in builds consistently passing for me.</p>\n\n<p>Dell XPS 15 laptop.</p>\n\n<p>Enabling hyper-v did not cause <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3Acc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:cc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" data-account-id=\"557058:cc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" accountid=\"557058:cc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Yinlin Chen</a>'s build to pass.</p>",
